# IRONVEX Supabase Backend Configuration

# 1. Obtain your Project URL and Anon Public Key from https://supabase.com
# 2. Rename this file to .env or create a new .env file
# 3. Paste your credentials below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key-here
